    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Medical College in East Africa (MCEA), through its Department of Internal Medicine, has been confirmed as a practical examination centre for postgraduate medical examinations for the Membership of the Royal Colleges of Physicians of the United Kingdom,  MRCP(UK) , a programme run on behalf of the three Royal Colleges of Physicians of the UK.",
